|Case|:**timer_functionality**
- **Error Analysis:** The timer countdown functionality is missing in the code.
- **Improvement Guidance:** 
  - Implement logic for a countdown timer that reduces time on updates, triggering end-of-game conditions when the timer hits zero.
  - Build a mechanism to visualize the timer during gameplay to inform users of the time remaining.


